 to our desired graph problems. This generalizes the prior results of Hardt and Talwar [STOC 2010] and Bun, Ullman and Vadhan [STOC 2014, SIAM J. Comput. 2018], who gave lower bounds on the additive error for the special case of mechanisms with no multiplicative error.
